                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>It is a branch of medical science dealing with parasites living in and on the body of humans and with aspects of this host-parasite relationships having medical significance. The content of rigorous course includes medical protozoa, medical helminthes and medical arthropods, many etiological agents responsible for global infectious diseases. It covers all biology, pathogenesis, diagnosis, epidemiology, treatment and prevention of parasites that related with infectious diseases in humans.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
